abstract: "Reproducible single-subject structural MRI workflow using FreeSurfer for cortical reconstruction, subcortical segmentation, regional cortical-thickness, area and volume extraction, and visual quality control. The documented run used recon-all with parallel processing and 8 OpenMP threads."
